    "body": "PR #1344 remains a corrected model draft: ordinary-form argument binding and the geometric comparison are incomplete. Main's roadmap needs to distinguish that draft from the accepted PR #1343 runtime and carry the independent review into the next run.\n\nThis change publishes the source/evidence review, original and corrected independent audits, executed checks and resource reconciliation, and a comprehensive completion brief. It updates README, roadmap, current state, project map and mechanism directions without merging the model draft. Corrected source is `1df229178c6b56ae6dbf95273c9e4eae3282a66e` on PR #1344.\n\nThe corrected draft restores 24/24 development and exposed answers, 48/48 cue-role and span fit, coherent source interventions and all 811 checkpoint continuations. 18 focused module and22 runner tests pass; one legacy artifact test is explicitly ignored. Exact ordinary-form/cross-BPE learned answers and H4 comparison remain unrun. The previous summary's alignment and role-error explanations are corrected, unique artifacts retained, and the missing prior debit recorded as an estimate.\n\nDocumentation validation: JSON parsing,1,028 relative document targets, claim wording and diff checks. Runtime validation belongs to the separately identified draft source; this PR changes no Rust files. Queue compatibility statuses are not tests.\n\nReferences #820, #973, #1139, #962, #963, #964. Do not close broad capability issues from this review.\n",
